      "avatar_template": "/user_avatar/forums.greaterthangames.com/trajector/{size}/1914_2.png",
      "created_at": "2017-06-08T01:33:47.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>I always think it’s funny how some bugs manifest. Like, why would this one particular instance of damage not get modifiers applied, when in general, damage modifiers apply to…damage?</p>\n<p>… I’ve seen plenty of similar things on my own, so I understand that complex systems sometimes have unexpected behaviors. It’s just funny to me HOW they come out sometimes.</p>",
